      "end_line": 124,
      "raw": "```qml\nimport LVRS 1.0 as LV\n\nLV.Hierarchy {\n    model: backendHierarchyModel\n    itemKeyRole: \"key\"\n    labelRole: \"name\"\n    depthRole: \"depth\"\n    countRole: \"counter\"\n}\n```\n",
      "language": "qml",
