      "kind": "fenced_code",
      "start_line": 147,
      "end_line": 157,
      "raw": "```qml\nimport LVRS 1.0 as LV\n\nLV.Hierarchy {\n    id: tree\n}\n\nfunction focusNodeByKey(key) {\n    tree.activateListItemByKey(key)\n}\n```\n",
